# ATtoOR — Mutual Aid NYC Service Directory

## Overview
Community service directory for NYC, built on HSDS 3.0 (Open Referral). Dual-stack: legacy Hetzner + zero-cost Cloudflare/Vercel.

## Tech Stack

### Legacy (Hetzner — services.wegov.nyc)
- **Backend**: FastAPI (Python) — port 8300
- **Frontend**: Next.js — port 3100
- **Database**: SQLite (FTS5)
- **Data source**: Airtable

### Zero-Cost (Cloudflare + Vercel)
- **Backend**: Cloudflare Worker (`hsds-api`) — Hono + D1
- **Frontend**: Vercel (`hsdirectory-v2`) — Next.js
- **MCP Server**: `/mcp` on the Worker (5 tools via McpAgent Durable Object)
- **Chat**: `/api/chat` — RAG with Workers AI (Llama 3.3 70B)
- **Sync**: Airtable → D1 every 15 min via cron trigger

## Repository Layout
```
ATtoOR/
├── airtable/         # Python Airtable client + sync (legacy)
├── db/               # Python SQLite database (legacy)
├── routes/           # FastAPI routes (legacy)
├── transform/        # Airtable→HSDS mapper (legacy)
├── hsdirectory/      # Next.js frontend (legacy, Hetzner)
├── hsdirectory-v2/   # Next.js frontend (Vercel fork)
├── worker/           # Cloudflare Worker (API + MCP + Chat)
│   └── src/
│       ├── routes/   # Hono REST endpoints
│       ├── sync/     # Airtable→D1 sync engine
│       ├── mcp/      # MCP Agent (Durable Object)
│       ├── chat/     # RAG chat handler
│       └── db/       # D1 schema + queries
├── utils/            # Geocoder, haversine
└── geocache.json     # Nominatim geocode cache (145 entries)
```

## Deployment

### Cloudflare Worker
- URL: https://hsds-api.devin-d41.workers.dev
- D1 DB: `hsds-directory` (0fc18275-0eed-4d31-9d7d-02c43f4fed10)
- Secrets: `AIRTABLE_API_KEY`, `AIRTABLE_BASE_ID` (via `wrangler secret put`)
- Deploy: `cd worker && npx wrangler deploy`

### Vercel Frontend
- URL: https://hsdirectory-v2.vercel.app
- Env: `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://hsds-api.devin-d41.workers.dev`
- Deploy: `cd hsdirectory-v2 && npx vercel --prod`

## Gotchas
- D1 has no FTS5 — search uses `LIKE` on `json_extract()`
- Free plan Durable Objects need `new_sqlite_classes` migration
- Full sync exceeds CPU limits on fetch — use per-table `/sync/table/:name` or let cron handle it
- Airtable table IDs in `worker/src/sync/airtable-client.ts` must match Python client
- Geocache coordinates supplement location records for map display
